+In order to preserve the 8-bit ROM download interface with MiST, _jtframe_mister_ presents it too. However it can operate internally with 16-bit packets if the macro **JTFRAME_MR_FASTIO** is set to 1: _jtframe_mister_fastio_ turns each 16-bit download word into two byte writes and joins two bytes into one word for uploads (NVRAM saves), so the rest of JTFRAME keeps the 8-bit interface.
 
